      "summary_en": "Hammer Stance: Deals magic damage to an enemy and knocks them back a short distance. Cannon Stance: Deploys an Acceleration Gate increasing the Move Speed of all allied champions who pass through it. If Shock Blast is fired through the gate the missile speed, range, and damage will increase.",
      "summary_zh": "锤形态：对一个敌人造成魔法伤害，并将目标击退一小段距离。 炮形态：展开一个加速之门，所有穿过它的友军英雄都会得到移动速度加成。如果电能震荡穿过这个门发射，那么它的弹道速度和射程都会得到提高，并且伤害会提升。",
